{"id":"2ca0c3180b26a019","group":"93","path":"93/93-lem-compactness-finite.md","title":"Compactness Finite","display":"Compactness Finite","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-lem-compactness-finite","aliases":["93-lem-compactness-finite"],"display":"Compactness Finite","authors":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi","book_title":"Algebraizable Logics","depends_on":["[[93-df-compactness]]","[[93-lem-compactness-equivalent]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-lem-compactness-finite"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-lem-compactness-finite</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Compactness Finite"},{"key":"authors","html":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi"},{"key":"book_title","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f3b6daa28ddd9b5d\" href=\"?note=f3b6daa28ddd9b5d\" title=\"93-df-compactness\">93-df-compactness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"33b00fd0b4d5a311\" href=\"?note=33b00fd0b4d5a311\" title=\"93-lem-compactness-equivalent\">93-lem-compactness-equivalent</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"lem-compactness-finite---Compactness-Finite\">lem-compactness-finite - Compactness Finite</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> is a formula-set candidate, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash\\subseteq\\mathcal P(F)\\times F\">\\(\\vdash\\subseteq\\mathcal P(F)\\times F\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Compact}_{93}(\\vdash;F)\">\\(\\mathrm{Compact}_{93}(\\vdash;F)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq F\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq F\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in F\">\\(\\varphi\\in F\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\Gamma]^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\([\\Gamma]^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> is the set of finite subsets of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\">\\(\\Gamma\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Compact}_{93}(\\vdash;F)\\land\\Gamma\\vdash\\varphi\n\\to\\exists\\Gamma_0\\in[\\Gamma]^{&lt;\\omega}\\;(\\Gamma_0\\vdash\\varphi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Compact}_{93}(\\vdash;F)\\land\\Gamma\\vdash\\varphi\n\\to\\exists\\Gamma_0\\in[\\Gamma]^{&lt;\\omega}\\;(\\Gamma_0\\vdash\\varphi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>Compactness reduces each derivability claim to a finite subclaim.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"lem-compactness-finite---Compactness-Finite","text":"lem-compactness-finite - Compactness Finite","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-compactness","status":"resolved","id":"f3b6daa28ddd9b5d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-compactness]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-lem-compactness-equivalent","status":"resolved","id":"33b00fd0b4d5a311","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-lem-compactness-equivalent]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"\\vdash\\subseteq\\mathcal P(F)\\times F","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Compact}_{93}(\\vdash;F)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\subseteq F","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in F","display":false},{"tex":"[\\Gamma]^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Compact}_{93}(\\vdash;F)\\land\\Gamma\\vdash\\varphi\n\\to\\exists\\Gamma_0\\in[\\Gamma]^{<\\omega}\\;(\\Gamma_0\\vdash\\varphi).","display":true}],"bytes":829,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["f3b6daa28ddd9b5d","33b00fd0b4d5a311"]}